## Type

🆕 New Feature

## Changes

- Enables sending request in openai format to Gemini's live api 
- Supports returning response for the following OpenAI events:
   - [x] session.created
   - [x] response.created~~
   - [x] return response.output_item.added ← adds ‘item_id’ same for all subsequent events
   - [x] return conversation.item.created
   - [x] return response.content_part.added
   - [x] return [[response.text.delta](http://response.text.delta/)](http://response.text.delta) ← contains actual streamed text
   - [x] handles consecutive deltas
   - [x] return response.text.done ← complete text
   - [x] return response.content_part.done 
   - [x] return response.output_item.done
   - [x] return response.done ← contains usage

Next Steps:
- [ ] handle output index for consecutive deltas 
- [ ] fix usage calculation 
- [ ] add audio support 
- [ ] support optional params 
- [ ] QA: verify request is logged 
- [ ] QA: verify cost is tracked

This PR update add `defaultDateCellRenderer` to custom date cell renderer (issue #18)

#### Example

``` java
datePicker.setDefaultDateCellRenderer(new CustomDateCellRenderer());
```

